  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;type&lt;/b&gt;: slot&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;is-a&lt;/b&gt;: Structural slot&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:slot-inverse&lt;/b&gt;: member of&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:direct-superslots&lt;/b&gt;: part&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:documentation&lt;/b&gt;: Has_part relation which holds between each anatomical set and any of its elements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:direct-domain&lt;/b&gt;: Vasculature of bony part of vertebra, Set of immaterial anatomical entities, Heterogeneous anatomical cluster&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:slot-value-type&lt;/b&gt;: Material anatomical entity, Anatomical set, Class, Immaterial anatomical entity, Developmental entity</obo:IAO_0000116>
