  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Pontic utilized as an interim of at least six months duration during restorative treatment to allow adequate time for healing or completion of other procedures.  This is not to be used as a temporary pontic for routine prosthetic fixed partial dentures. 

 ISBN:1935201387#CDT 2011-2012 Current Dental Terminology, Chapter 1</obo:IAO_0000116>
  <obo:cdt_label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">provisional pontic</obo:cdt_label>
