  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Retainer crown utilized as an interim of at least six months duration during restorative treatment to allow adequate time for healing or completion of other procedures.  This is not to be used as a temporary retainer crown for routine prosthetic fixed partial dentures. 

