  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Retainer crown used as an interim restoration  for a duration of less than six months when a final impression is not made to allow adequate time for healing or completion of definitive treatment  planning. This is not a temporary retainer crown for routine prosthetic fixed partial denture restoration. 

