  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Each retainer and each pontic constitutes a unit in a fixed partial denture.
Local anesthesia is usually considered to be part of Fixed Prosthodontic procedures.
The term 'fixed partial denture' replaces the words 'bridge' and 'bridgework' throughout this section. 

 ISBN:1935201387#CDT 2011-2012 Current Dental Terminology, Chapter 1</obo:IAO_0000116>
