has boundary: true
dimension: 3-dimension
:direct-template-slots: has mass, continuous with, attributed continuous with, physical state, has shape, branch, receives drainage from</obo:IAO_0000116>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical anatomical entity which has mass. Examples: hemoglobin molecule, mitochondrion, hepatocyte, erythrocyte, heart, head, blood, urine.</rdfs:comment>
