  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;type&lt;/b&gt;: class&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;is-a&lt;/b&gt;: Heterogeneous anatomical cluster&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:slot-templates&lt;/b&gt;: location &lt;i&gt;value-type&lt;/i&gt;: Organ anatomical coordinate adjacency, location &lt;i&gt;value-type&lt;/i&gt;: Has_anatomical_coordinate relation, location &lt;i&gt;value-type&lt;/i&gt;: Instance&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;arterial supply&lt;/b&gt;: Right lingual artery, Left lingual artery, Right ascending palatine artery, Left ascending palatine artery, Right tonsillar artery, Left tonsillar artery&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;location&lt;/b&gt;: Palatine process of right maxilla(Superior), Palatine process of left maxilla(Superior)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;preferred name&lt;/b&gt;: KB_INSTANCE_69420&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;inherent 3-D shape&lt;/b&gt;: Semi-cone&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;nerve supply&lt;/b&gt;: Right lingual nerve, Left lingual nerve, Right hypoglossal nerve, Left hypoglossal nerve&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;bounded by&lt;/b&gt;: Superior surface of tongue, Inferior surface of tongue&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;orientation&lt;/b&gt;: Apex of tongue(Anterior), Dorsum of tongue(Superior), NIL(Posterior), Ventrum of tongue(Inferior)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;lymphatic drainage&lt;/b&gt;: Jugulodigastric lymphatic chain&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;non-English equivalent&lt;/b&gt;: ONARD_Instance_580061, ONARD_Instance_580490, KB_AUTO-INSERT(3)_1573, ONARD_Instance_580765, su_incus_35605, ONARD_Instance_610027&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;venous drainage&lt;/b&gt;: Left dorsal lingual vein, Right deep lingual vein, Left deep lingual vein, Right dorsal lingual vein&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;constitutional part&lt;/b&gt;: Neural network of tongue, Vasculature of tongue, Musculature of tongue, Mucosa of tongue&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;attributed part&lt;/b&gt;: Oral part of tongue, Posterior part of tongue&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;constitutional part of&lt;/b&gt;: Floor of mouth&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;regional part&lt;/b&gt;: Oral part o