  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Hyoglossal membrane</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_54820">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_54819"/>
  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;type&lt;/b&gt;: class&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;is-a&lt;/b&gt;: Papilla of tongue&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;preferred name&lt;/b&gt;: KB_INSTANCE_69669&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:documentation&lt;/b&gt;: Gray's 38th ed:1723 - Covering most of the presulcal dorsal area; minute, conical or cylindrical and arranged in diagonal rows; have irregular cores of connective tissue; with keratinized epithelium.</obo:IAO_0000116>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Filiform papilla of tongue</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_54821">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_54819"/>
  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;type&lt;/b&gt;: class&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;is-a&lt;/b&gt;: Papilla of tongue&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:slot-templates&lt;/b&gt;: arterial supply &lt;i&gt;value-type&lt;/i&gt;: Class, arterial supply &lt;i&gt;value-type&lt;/i&gt;: Portion of tissue&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;preferred name&lt;/b&gt;: KB_INSTANCE_69670&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:documentation&lt;/b&gt;: Gray's 38th ed:1723 - Occur mainly on the lingual margin, also on the dorsum; larger in size than filiform papilla, rounded in shape and deep red in color; usually bears one or more taste buds on its apical surface.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;synonym&lt;/b&gt;: ONARD_Instance_6380011</obo:IAO_0000116>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Fungiform papilla of tongue</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_54822">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_54819"/>
  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;type&lt;/b&gt;: class&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;is-a&lt;/b&gt;: Papilla of tongue&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;preferred name&lt;/b&gt;: KB_INSTANCE_69671&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:documentation&lt;/b&gt;: Gray's 38th ed:1723 - Large cylindrical structures on the dorsum of the tongue; forms a v-shaped row immediately in front of the sulcus terminalis; narrower at its base than its apex; entire structure is covered by stratified squamous epithelium; taste buds abound in both walls of the sulcus.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;synonym&lt;/b&gt;: fm-live_15714</obo:IAO_0000116>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Vallate papilla of tongue</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_54823">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_54819"/>
  <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;type&lt;/b&gt;: class&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;is-a&lt;/b&gt;: Papilla of tongue&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;preferred name&lt;/b&gt;: KB_INSTANCE_69672&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:documentation&lt;/b&gt;: Gray's 38th ed:1723 - Lying bilaterally; two zones; each formed by a series of red, leaf-like mucosal ridges at the sides of the tongue near the sulcus terminalis; bear numerous taste buds.</obo:IAO_0000116>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Foliate papilla of tongue</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

