  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Joint in which the articulating bones or cartilages are connected by an articular capsule which encloses a synovial membrane and a synovial cavity. Examples: Temporomandibular joint, knee joint.</rdfs:comment>
