  <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">c acts upstream of or within p if c is enables f, and f is causally upstream of or within p. c is a material entity and p is an process.</owl:annotatedTarget>
</owl:Axiom>

