  <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A bearer can have many functions, and its functions can exist for different periods of time, but none of its functions can exist when the bearer does not exist. A function need not be realized at all the times that the function exists.</owl:annotatedTarget>
</owl:Axiom>

